{"id":"ig_02","book":"ig","bookLabel":"Instagram & YouTube report","title":"What Works","tables":[{"cols":["A","K"],"rows":[["What kind of content works for us","","","","","","","","","",""],["Every table is live formulas over 'Post Log'. Hit rate = share of posts in the group that beat the account median for their creative type (50% = average; 65%+ = clearly working). It ignores a few viral outliers, unlike averages. Score columns fill in as watch data arrives. Groups with fewer than 5 posts are greyed out.","","","","","","","","","",""],[],["PLAYBOOK — what to stick to","","","","","","","","","",""],["HOOKS","Stick to: Celebrity face (67% beat median, 39 posts), Conflict / shock reveal (64% beat median, 67 posts). Drop or rework: Humour / meme (38%), Festival / topical tie-in (36%). Avg hook score so far 6.1/10.","","","","","","","","",""],["MID-ROLLS","Avg mid-roll score 5.0/10. Put a reveal, a shock beat or a new suspect at the halfway mark; if the midpoint is just more set-up, viewers drift.","","","","","","","","",""],["CLIFFHANGERS","Best endings: Twist tease (63% beat median, 62 posts), Open question (59% beat median, 170 posts). Weakest: None (36%), Promise of payoff / revenge (35%).","","","","","","","","",""],["CTA","Best CTAs: Download app / link (56% beat median, 62 posts), Watch on TukTuki (52% beat median, 353 posts). Weakest: Follow / share (30%). Pair whodunit endings with a comment prompt ('Comment karo, kaun hai asli gunehgaar?').","","","","","","","","",""],["LENGTH","Hit rate by length: 31–60s 58% (109), 120s+ 57% (70), 61–90s 56% (160), 91–120s 45% (62), 0–30s 26% (105). Aim for 31–60s.","","","","","","","","",""],["CONTENT MIX","Lean into: Behind the scenes (75% beat median, 8 posts), Topical / trend (67% beat median, 6 posts). Cut back: Celebrity / podcast (27%), App / brand promo (8%).","","","","","","","","",""],["SHOWS","Strongest organic IP: Pyaar Ka Face Value (100% beat median, 9 posts), Psychopath (100% beat median, 10 posts), Main Wapas Nahi Aaunga (100% beat median, 13 posts).","","","","","","","","",""],["CAPTIONS & SEO","Avg caption/SEO score 4.5/10. Common fixes: show name and hook in the first line, 3–5 relevant hashtags instead of #fyp/#explorepage, keyword block limited to show, genre and cast (no unrelated trending terms), and a comment prompt at the end.","","","","","","","","",""],[],["By hook type","","","","","","","","","",""],["Group","# Posts","Hit rate (beat median)","Avg interactions","Avg reach","Avg ER","Avg hook score","Avg mid-roll score","Avg cliffhanger score","Avg comments","Avg views"],["Story","165","46%","20","1,449","2.2%","","","","1","1,861"],["Question / mystery","145","55%","1,401","28,977","3.6%","6.7","5.3","5.2","7","52,585"],["Bold statement","136","43%","676","15,983","2.8%","5.7","4.6","4.5","8","28,291"],["Conflict / shock reveal","67","64%","2,352","37,249","5.7%","7.2","5.6","5.8","10","80,669"],["Humour / meme","47","38%","338","8,454","2.9%","5.1","5.2","4.0","2","14,726"],["Emotional moment","47","53%","557","13,027","3.5%","6.6","5.2","6.0","6","21,291"],["Celebrity face","41","68%","2,739","71,186","5.5%","5.5","4.7","5.5","34","139,176"],["Greeting","31","29%","100","5,325","1.7%","3.2","2.7","3.3","1","9,886"],["Other","22","32%","99","4,215","2.0%","5.2","5.8","5.0","3","7,892"],["Festival / topical tie-in","19","37%","770","13,994","2.9%","4.2","3.4","2.4","2","20,907"],["Suspect / whodunit","18","50%","1,851","42,573","3.0%","6.5","5.1","5.7","27","61,733"],[],["By cliffhanger / ending type","","","","","","","","","",""],["Group","# Posts","Hit rate (beat median)","Avg interactions","Avg reach","Avg ER","Avg hook score","Avg mid-roll score","Avg cliffhanger score","Avg comments","Avg views"],["None","217","37%","653","17,092","2.7%","4.8","4.2","4.0","6","28,241"],["Open question","173","60%","1,664","30,234","3.7%","7.2","5.4","5.8","8","56,963"],["Story","165","46%","20","1,449","2.2%","","","","1","1,861"],["Coming soon / release 